You focus on a target zone of radius 2 to make up to [2, 2, 3, 3, 4 (TL1-5)] corrosive seeds appear.

The first seed will appear at the center of the target zone, while others will appear at random spots.

Each seed lasts [4, 5, 6, 7, 7 (TL1-5)] turns and will explode when a hostile creature walks over it, knocking the creature back and dealing [178, 240, 287, 328, 364 (TL1-5; MP 100)] Acid damage within radius 1.

The damage will increase with your Mindpower.
